    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let it go\"... what does that even mean? there's no dignity in being captured. they'll parade me through the streets like a trophy. i've lived my life by a code, and it's all gone to ash. if there's no path back to what i was... then what's the point of any of this?",
